[{"category":"section","location":"#CommonDataFormat.jl","page":"Home","text":"(Image: DOI) (Image: version)\n\nA Julia package for reading Common Data Format (CDF) files, widely used in space physics for storing multidimensional data arrays and metadata. See CDFDatasets.jl for a high-level interface.","title":"CommonDataFormat.jl"},{"category":"section","location":"#Installation","page":"Home","text":"using Pkg\nPkg.add(\"CommonDataFormat\")","title":"Installation"},{"category":"section","location":"#Quick-Start","page":"Home","text":"using CommonDataFormat\n\n# Load a CDF file\nomni_file = joinpath(pkgdir(CommonDataFormat), \"data/omni_coho1hr_merged_mag_plasma_20240901_v01.cdf\")\nds = CDFDataset(omni_file)\nCDFDataset{Int64}\npath: /home/runner/work/CommonDataFormat.jl/CommonDataFormat.jl/data/omni_coho1hr_merged_mag_plasma_20240901_v01.cdf\nvariables:\n  Epoch : (720,) \u001b[0m\u001b[1msupport_data\u001b[22m CDF_EPOCH [2024-09-01T00:00:00 … 2024-09-30T23:00:00]\n  heliographicLatitude : (720,) \u001b[0m\u001b[1mdata\u001b[22m CDF_REAL4 [7.2 … 6.8]\n  heliographicLongitude : (720,) \u001b[0m\u001b[1mdata\u001b[22m CDF_REAL4 [261.6 … 291.0]\n  BR : (720,) \u001b[0m\u001b[1mdata\u001b[22m CDF_REAL4 [6.7 … -2.6]\n  BT : (720,) \u001b[0m\u001b[1mdata\u001b[22m CDF_REAL4 [-8.2 … 2.1]\n  BN : (720,) \u001b[0m\u001b[1mdata\u001b[22m CDF_REAL4 [-3.6 … 3.5]\n  ABS_B : (720,) \u001b[0m\u001b[1mdata\u001b[22m CDF_REAL4 [11.4 … 6.7]\n  V : (720,) \u001b[0m\u001b[1mdata\u001b[22m CDF_REAL4 [377.0 … 424.0]\n  elevAngle : (720,) \u001b[0m\u001b[1mdata\u001b[22m CDF_REAL4 [-2.5 … 5.6]\n  azimuthAngle : (720,) \u001b[0m\u001b[1mdata\u001b[22m CDF_REAL4 [1.7 … -1.9]\n  N : (720,) \u001b[0m\u001b[1mdata\u001b[22m CDF_REAL4 [4.5 … 3.6]\n  T : (720,) \u001b[0m\u001b[1mdata\u001b[22m CDF_REAL4 [82095.0 … 107645.0]\nCDR (CDF Descriptor Record):\n  Version: 3.9.0\n  Encoding: 1\n  Flags: 0x00000003\n    - Majority: Row\n    - Single File Format: true\n    - Checksum Used: false\n    - MD5 Checksum: false\n  Identifier: -1\n\nattributes: Dict{String, Vector} with 28 entries:\n  \"Instrument_type\"            => [\"Plasma and Solar Wind\", \"Magnetic Fields (s…\n  \"Logical_source_description\" => [\"OMNI Combined merged hourly magnetic field,…\n  \"LINK_TEXT\"                  => [\"COHO dataset\", \"Additional analysis tools f…\n  \"Source_name\"                => [\"OMNI (1AU IP Data)>Merged 1 Hour Interplant…\n  \"spase_DatasetResourceID\"    => [\"spase://NASA/NumericalData/OMNI/COHO/Merged…\n  \"Time_resolution\"            => [\"1 hour\"]\n  \"Project\"                    => [\"SPDF\"]\n  \"LINK_TITLE\"                 => [\"Documentation\", \"COHOWeb service\"]\n  \"Discipline\"                 => [\"Space Physics>Interplanetary Studies\"]\n  \"MODS\"                       => [\"created July 2007;\", \"conversion to ISTP/IA…\n  \"PI_name\"                    => [\"J.H. King, N. Papatashvilli\"]\n  \"Acknowledgement\"            => [\"NSSDC\"]\n  \"Generated_by\"               => [\"King/Papatashvilli\"]\n  \"Descriptor\"                 => [\"merged magnetic field and plasma data from …\n  \"Data_version\"               => [\"1\"]\n  \"Logical_source\"             => [\"omni_coho1hr_merged_mag_plasma\"]\n  \"Logical_file_id\"            => [\"omni_coho1hr_merged_mag_plasma_00000000_v01…\n  \"TEXT\"                       => [\"Hourly averaged definitive multispacecraft …\n  \"alt_logical_source\"         => [\"Combined_OMNI_1AU-MagneticField-Plasma-Part…\n  ⋮                            => ⋮","title":"Quick Start"},{"category":"section","location":"#API-Reference","page":"Home","text":"","title":"API Reference"},{"category":"type","location":"#CommonDataFormat.ADR","page":"Home","text":"Attribute Descriptor Record (ADR)\n\nContains a description of an attribute in a CDF. There will be one ADR per attribute. The ADRhead field of the ADR contains the file offset of the first ADR.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"CommonDataFormat.ADR"},{"category":"type","location":"#CommonDataFormat.AEDR","page":"Home","text":"AEDR\n\nAttribute g/r Entry Descriptor Record. Describes a global entry (for global attributes) or rVariable entry (for variable attributes).\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"CommonDataFormat.AEDR"},{"category":"method","location":"#CommonDataFormat.CDFDataset-Tuple{Any}","page":"Home","text":"CDFDataset(filename)\n\nLoad a CDF file and return a CDFDataset object.\n\nExample\n\ncdf = CDFDataset(\"data.cdf\")\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"CommonDataFormat.CDFDataset"},{"category":"type","location":"#CommonDataFormat.CDR","page":"Home","text":"CDF Descriptor Record (CDR) - the main file header record Contains version, encoding, format information, and pointer to GDR\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"CommonDataFormat.CDR"},{"category":"type","location":"#CommonDataFormat.Epoch","page":"Home","text":"Epoch\n\nMilliseconds since Year 0 (01-Jan-0000 00:00:00.000) Represented as a single double.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"CommonDataFormat.Epoch"},{"category":"type","location":"#CommonDataFormat.Epoch16","page":"Home","text":"Epoch16\n\nPicoseconds since Year 0 (01-Jan-0000 00:00:00.000.000.000.000) Represented as two doubles (seconds and picoseconds).\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"CommonDataFormat.Epoch16"},{"category":"type","location":"#CommonDataFormat.GDR","page":"Home","text":"Global Descriptor Record (GDR) - contains global information about the CDF file Points to variable and attribute descriptor records\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"CommonDataFormat.GDR"},{"category":"type","location":"#CommonDataFormat.Header","page":"Home","text":"CDF Record header structure - common to all record types\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"CommonDataFormat.Header"},{"category":"type","location":"#CommonDataFormat.TT2000","page":"Home","text":"TT2000\n\nNanoseconds since J2000 (01-Jan-2000 12:00:00.000.000.000) with leap seconds, represented as an 8-byte integer.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"CommonDataFormat.TT2000"},{"category":"type","location":"#CommonDataFormat.VDR","page":"Home","text":"Variable Descriptor Record (VDR) - describes a single variable\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"CommonDataFormat.VDR"},{"category":"method","location":"#CommonDataFormat.VDR-Union{Tuple{FieldSizeT}, Tuple{Vector{UInt8}, Any}} where FieldSizeT","page":"Home","text":"VDR{FieldSizeT}(buffer, offset)\n\nLoad a z-Variable Descriptor Record from the buffer at the specified offset.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"CommonDataFormat.VDR"},{"category":"type","location":"#CommonDataFormat.VXR","page":"Home","text":"Variable Index Record (VXR) - contains pointers to variable data records\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"CommonDataFormat.VXR"},{"category":"method","location":"#CommonDataFormat.rVDR-Union{Tuple{FieldSizeT}, Tuple{Vector{UInt8}, Any}} where FieldSizeT","page":"Home","text":"rVDR{FieldSizeT}(buffer, offset)\n\nLoad an r-Variable Descriptor Record from the buffer at the specified offset.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"CommonDataFormat.rVDR"},{"category":"method","location":"#CommonDataFormat.attrib-Tuple{CDFDataset}","page":"Home","text":"attrib(cdf::CDFDataset)\n\nLoad all attributes from the CDF file.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"CommonDataFormat.attrib"},{"category":"method","location":"#CommonDataFormat.attrib-Union{Tuple{FST}, Tuple{CDFDataset{FST}, String}} where FST","page":"Home","text":"attrib(cdf::CDFDataset, attribute_name::String)\n\nRetrieve all entries for a named attribute from the CDF file.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"CommonDataFormat.attrib"},{"category":"method","location":"#CommonDataFormat.attribnames-Union{Tuple{CDFDataset{FST}}, Tuple{FST}} where FST","page":"Home","text":"attribnames(cdf::CDFDataset)\n\nReturn a list of attribute names in the CDF file.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"CommonDataFormat.attribnames"},{"category":"method","location":"#CommonDataFormat.decode_cdr_flags-Tuple{Any}","page":"Home","text":"decode_cdr_flags(flags::UInt32)\n\nDecode the CDR flags field into individual boolean flags.\n\nCDF Flags (from CDF specification):\n\nBit 0: Majority (1=row-major, 0=column-major)\nBit 1: File format (1=single-file, 0=multi-file)\nBit 2: Checksum used (1=checksum present, 0=no checksum)\nBit 3: MD5 checksum method (requires bit 2=1)\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"CommonDataFormat.decode_cdr_flags"},{"category":"method","location":"#CommonDataFormat.is_nrv-Tuple{Any}","page":"Home","text":"Whether or not the variable is a non-record variable\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"CommonDataFormat.is_nrv"}]
